{"id":60,"name":"Al-Mumtahanah","nameAr":"الممتحنة","nameFr":"L'éprouvée","place":"madinah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"60:1","fr":"Ô vous qui avez cru ! Ne prenez pas pour alliés Mon ennemi et le vôtre, leur offrant l’amitié, alors qu’ils ont nié ce qui vous est parvenu de la vérité. Ils expulsent le Messager et vous-mêmes parce que vous croyez en Allah, votre Seigneur. Si vous êtes sortis pour lutter dans Mon chemin et pour rechercher Mon agrément, leur témoignerez-vous secrètement de l’amitié, alors que Je connais parfaitement ce que vous cachez et ce que vous divulguez ? Et quiconque d’entre vous le fait s’égare de la droiture du sentier.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/060001.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O you","tr":"yāayyuhā","l":"أَيّ","r":"أيي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en":"who","tr":"alladhīna","l":"الَّذِي","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/060_001_002.mp3"},{"t":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en":"believe","tr":"āmanū","l":"آمَنَ","r":"أمن","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"لَا","en":"(Do) not","tr":"lā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/060_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"تَتَّخِذُوا۟","en":"take","tr":"tattakhidhū","l":"اتَّخَذَ","r":"أخذ","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_001_005.mp3"},{"t":"عَدُوِّى","en":"My enemies","tr":"ʿaduwwī","l":"عَدُوّ","r":"عدو","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_001_006.mp3"},{"t":"وَعَدُوَّكُمْ","en":"and your enemies","tr":"waʿaduwwakum","l":"عَدُوّ","r":"عدو","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_001_007.mp3"},{"t":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","en":"(as) allies","tr":"awliyāa","l":"وَلِيّ","r":"ولي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_001_008.mp3"},{"t":"تُلْقُونَ","en":"offering","tr":"tul'qūna","l":"أَلْقَى","r":"لقي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_001_009.mp3"},{"t":"إِلَيْهِم","en":"them","tr":"ilayhim","l":"إِلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/060_001_010.mp3"},{"t":"بِٱلْمَوَدَّةِ","en":"love","tr":"bil-mawadati","l":"مَوَدَّة","r":"ودد","p":"nom","a":"wbw/060_001_011.mp3"},{"t":"وَقَدْ","en":"while","tr":"waqad","l":"قَد","r":null,"p":"pré