,"a":"wbw/060_001_051.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"60:2","fr":"S’ils vous dominent, ils seront des ennemis pour vous et étendront en mal leurs mains et leurs langues vers vous ; et ils aimeraient que vous deveniez mécréants.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/060002.mp3","w":[{"t":"إِن","en":"If","tr":"in","l":"إِن","r":null,"p":"condition","a":"wbw/060_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"يَثْقَفُوكُمْ","en":"they gain dominance over you","tr":"yathqafūkum","l":"ثُقِفُ","r":"ثقف","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_002_002.mp3"},{"t":"يَكُونُوا۟","en":"they would be","tr":"yakūnū","l":"كانَ","r":"كون","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_002_003.mp3"},{"t":"لَكُمْ","en":"to you","tr":"lakum","l":"لَكُمْ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/060_002_004.mp3"},{"t":"أَعْدَآءًۭ","en":"enemies","tr":"aʿdāan","l":"عَدُوّ","r":"عدو","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_002_005.mp3"},{"t":"وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟","en":"and extend","tr":"wayabsuṭū","l":"بَسَطَ","r":"بسط","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_002_006.mp3"},{"t":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en":"against you","tr":"ilaykum","l":"إِلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/060_002_007.mp3"},{"t":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ","en":"their hands","tr":"aydiyahum","l":"يَد","r":"يدي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_002_008.mp3"},{"t":"وَأَلْسِنَتَهُم","en":"and their tongues","tr":"wa-alsinatahum","l":"لِسان","r":"لسن","p":"particule","a":"wbw/060_002_009.mp3"},{"t":"بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","en":"with evil","tr":"bil-sūi","l":"سُوء","r":"سوأ","p":"nom","a":"wbw/060_002_010.mp3"},{"t":"وَوَدُّوا۟","en":"and they desire","tr":"wawaddū","l":"وَدَّ","r":"ودد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_002_011.mp3"},{"t":"لَوْ","en":"that","tr":"law","l":"لَو","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/060_002_012.mp3"},{"t":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en":"you would disbelieve","tr":"takfurūna","l":"كَفَرَ","r":"كفر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/060_002_013.mp3"}]},{"n":3,"k":"60:3","fr":"Ni vos proches parents ni vos enfants ne vous seront d’aucune utilité le Jour de la Résurrection, Il [Allah] décidera entre vous, et Allah est Clairvoyant sur ce que vous faites.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/060003.mp3","w"